{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "GraphQL Basics - NestJS",
    "description": "Colección de operaciones GraphQL para el proyecto NestJS con autenticación JWT.\n\n**URL base:** `http://localhost:9000/graphql`\n\n**Cómo usar:**\n1. Ejecuta **signup** o **login** — el token se guarda automáticamente en la variable `token`.\n2. Usa **user** (query) con el token ya guardado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9000/graphql",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token guardado automáticamente al hacer signup o login"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID del usuario guardado automáticamente al hacer signup o login"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Operaciones de autenticación: registro e inicio de sesión.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "signup",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.signup) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.signup.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.data.signup.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token guardado:', res.data.signup.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ UserId guardado:', res.data.signup.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Signup exitoso', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.signup).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.signup).to.have.property('user');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "mutation Signup($signupInput: SignUpInput!) {\n  signup(signupInput: $signupInput) {\n    token\n    user {\n      id\n      fullName\n      email\n      roles\n      isActive\n    }\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{\n  \"signupInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Passw0rd123\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Usuario Ejemplo\"\n  }\n}"
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario en el sistema.\n\n**Campos requeridos:**\n- `email` — correo electrónico válido\n- `password` — mínimo 6 caracteres\n- `fullName` — nombre completo (no vacío)\n\n**Retorna:** `AuthResponse` con el token JWT y los datos del usuario.\n\n> El token y el userId se guardan automáticamente en las variables de la colección."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Signup exitoso",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "mutation Signup($signupInput: SignUpInput!) {\n  signup(signupInput: $signupInput) {\n    token\n    user {\n      id\n      fullName\n      email\n      roles\n      isActive\n    }\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"signupInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Passw0rd123\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Usuario Ejemplo\"\n  }\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"signup\": {\n      \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n      \"user\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-generado\",\n        \"fullName\": \"Usuario Ejemplo\",\n        \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n        \"roles\": [\"teacher\"],\n        \"isActive\": true\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Error - Email inválido",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "mutation Signup($signupInput: SignUpInput!) {\n  signup(signupInput: $signupInput) {\n    token\n    user { id }\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"signupInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"no-es-email\",\n    \"password\": \"123456\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Test\"\n  }\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"message\": \"Bad Request Exception\",\n      \"extensions\": {\n        \"code\": \"BAD_USER_INPUT\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.login) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.login.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.data.login.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token guardado:', res.data.login.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ UserId guardado:', res.data.login.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Login exitoso', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.login).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.login).to.have.property('user');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "mutation Login($loginInput: LoginInput!) {\n  login(loginInput: $loginInput) {\n    token\n    user {\n      id\n      fullName\n      email\n      roles\n      isActive\n    }\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{\n  \"loginInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Passw0rd123\"\n  }\n}"
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "Autentica un usuario existente con email y contraseña.\n\n**Campos requeridos:**\n- `email` — correo electrónico válido\n- `password` — mínimo 6 caracteres\n\n**Retorna:** `AuthResponse` con el token JWT y los datos del usuario.\n\n> El token y el userId se guardan automáticamente en las variables de la colección."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Login exitoso",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "mutation Login($loginInput: LoginInput!) {\n  login(loginInput: $loginInput) {\n    token\n    user {\n      id\n      fullName\n      email\n      roles\n      isActive\n    }\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"loginInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Passw0rd123\"\n  }\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"login\": {\n      \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n      \"user\": {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-del-usuario\",\n        \"fullName\": \"Usuario Ejemplo\",\n        \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n        \"roles\": [\"teacher\"],\n        \"isActive\": true\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Error - Credenciales inválidas",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "mutation Login($loginInput: LoginInput!) {\n  login(loginInput: $loginInput) {\n    token\n    user { id }\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"loginInput\": {\n    \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n    \"password\": \"contraseña-incorrecta\"\n  }\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"message\": \"Credentials are not valid\",\n      \"extensions\": {\n        \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Queries relacionadas con usuarios. Algunas requieren el token JWT en el header Authorization.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "getAll (solo admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Lista de usuarios retornada', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data).to.have.property('getAll');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.getAll).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "description": "Token JWT de un usuario con rol 'admin'"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "query GetAll {\n  getAll {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n    roles\n    isActive\n  }\n}",
                "variables": ""
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna la lista completa de usuarios.\n\n⚠️ **Requiere rol `admin`** — el token JWT debe pertenecer a un usuario con `roles: [\"admin\"]`.\n\n**Header requerido:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n**Roles disponibles:** `admin`, `teacher`, `superadmin`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Lista de usuarios (admin)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "query GetAll {\n  getAll {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n    roles\n    isActive\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": ""
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"getAll\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-1\",\n        \"fullName\": \"Admin User\",\n        \"email\": \"admin@ejemplo.com\",\n        \"roles\": [\"admin\"],\n        \"isActive\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"uuid-2\",\n        \"fullName\": \"Teacher User\",\n        \"email\": \"teacher@ejemplo.com\",\n        \"roles\": [\"teacher\"],\n        \"isActive\": true\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Error - Sin permisos (no es admin)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "query GetAll {\n  getAll {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": ""
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"message\": \"Forbidden resource\",\n      \"extensions\": {\n        \"code\": \"FORBIDDEN\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Error - Sin token",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "query GetAll {\n  getAll {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": ""
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"message\": \"Unauthorized\",\n      \"extensions\": {\n        \"code\": \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "user (findOne)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Usuario encontrado', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data).to.have.property('user');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.data.user).to.have.property('id');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}",
                "description": "Token JWT obtenido del login o signup"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "query FindUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n    roles\n    isActive\n  }\n}",
                "variables": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"]
            },
            "description": "Busca un usuario por su UUID.\n\n**Parámetros:**\n- `id` — UUID del usuario (se autocompleta con `{{userId}}` guardado del login/signup)\n\n**Header requerido:** `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n\n> Asegúrate de haber hecho login o signup antes para tener el token y userId disponibles."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Usuario encontrado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "query FindUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n    roles\n    isActive\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"uuid-del-usuario\",\n      \"fullName\": \"Usuario Ejemplo\",\n      \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n      \"roles\": [\"teacher\"],\n      \"isActive\": true\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Error - Usuario no encontrado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "graphql",
                  "graphql": {
                    "query": "query FindUser($id: String!) {\n  user(id: $id) {\n    id\n    fullName\n    email\n  }\n}",
                    "variables": "{\n  \"id\": \"id-que-no-existe\"\n}"
                  }
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"message\": \"User id-que-no-existe not found\",\n      \"extensions\": {\n        \"code\": \"INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
